    "review_summary": "All 71 fixed-scope hashes match. Reviewed the seven formal pages, one implementation, three bindings, shared map and reverse weapon index. I–IV all format as +50% with 2/3/4/5-second active windows. The actual qualifying action is the held same-item elite melee weapon-special slap sweep; ordinary light/heavy, push/follow-up and the non-special fist sweeps do not qualify. The single timer refreshes without stacking or extra cooldown; holster gates new events and active stats while time continues, and true unequip removes the on-equip Buff. The proc resets the regeneration delay after hit damage and grants no instant toughness. The base-rate/coherency examples, geometric AI occupied-slot condition, missing-toughness cap, subsequent damage delay, RAW five-column comparison, actual three model names, and icon 212 receipt are consistent. No issue found."
  },
